# ==============================================================================
# AI COURT - Environment Configuration Template
# ==============================================================================

# --- AI Integration (Optional) ---
# If left blank, AI Court will seamlessly utilize its built-in Intelligent Heuristic
# Magistrate and Opponent procedural generator with zero external network dependencies.
# To enable live Generative AI with Google Gemini:
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# --- Supabase Database & Realtime Backend (Optional) ---
# If left blank, AI Court runs in Local Demo Mode, using localStorage for account
# persistence and cross-tab BroadcastChannel for realtime peer lobbies.
# To connect a live Supabase project for PostgreSQL, Auth, and Realtime:
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_supabase_anon_public_key_here
